      "detail": "pub interface Source {\n  fn read_bytes(Self, Int) -> Result<Option<bytes::Bytes>, io::Error>\n}",
      "documentation": {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "value": "A stream that bytes are read from. `read_bytes(source, limit)` returns the next bytes of the\nstream, at most `limit` of them, or `Ok(None)` at its end. `file::File`, `net::Connection` and\nthe standard-stream handles satisfy it through their modules' `read_bytes` (D-1062, D-1071)."
