      "detail": "pub fn copy<S: io::Source, K: io::Sink>(source: S, sink: K) -> Result<Int, io::Error>",
      "documentation": {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "value": "Reads blocks of at most 64 KiB from `source` until its end, writes each one to `sink`, and\nreturns the number of bytes copied (D-1072). It stops at the first `Err` of either side and\nreturns it; what was written before stays written."
      },
